# Kandelo patch rationale (S05)
# Judgment: Weak. The ELF/Wasm mismatch is real, but skipping every
# networking check is broader than necessary.
#
# Mozilla's networking-symbol checker expects ELF binaries, but this build
# produces Wasm. Its existing inspection cannot be used unchanged; the
# runtime OS and Node bridge cannot repair a build-time binary-format
# mismatch. This patch currently skips the check, which is broader than the
# demonstrated need. Replace the skip with a Wasm-aware check of applicable
# restrictions; retention does not establish that bypassing validation is
# necessary.
#
# Retained provisionally; see README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

--- a/python/mozbuild/mozbuild/action/check_binary.py
